        "Experiment: Why Might Student Students Fail",
        "to Mimic Teachers?",
        "Cho and Hariharan. On the Efficacy of Knowledge Distillation. ICCV 2019",
        "Hypothesis: student is",
        "underfitting because of lower",
        "capacity and so “minimizing one",
        "loss (KD loss) at the expense of",
        "the other (cross entropy loss)”"
      ]
    },
