        "to Mimic Teachers?",
        "Cho and Hariharan. On the Efficacy of Knowledge Distillation. ICCV 2019",
        "How to overcome this issue?",
        "- Early stopping with KD loss",
        "(ESKD) to leverage its benefit",
        "at the start of training"
